                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e56e0f6-d920-4711-b711-dd9632fd014c",
                                                "sense_id": "42b932e2-5e84-3ac3-8237-56938c4c2d65",
                                                "text": "You mix habs into the cheese before stuffing your poppers […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7408fcff-0e18-495d-8d20-bf64de691e44",
                                                "sense_id": "42b932e2-5e84-3ac3-8237-56938c4c2d65",
                                                "text": "“Where to, you crazy kids?” “Buffalo Wild Wings. It's all you can eat jalapeno poppers night.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87ccef2b-fbf5-4c77-a5e8-2f3194030945",
                                                "sense_id": "42b932e2-5e84-3ac3-8237-56938c4c2d65",
                                                "text": "“What are those things you are always eating?” “Pizza bagels?” “No.” “Pizza rolls?” “No.” “Pizza poppers?” “No.” “Pizzaritos?” “No.” “Pizza pockets?” “That's it.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e887f390-21af-4e48-826a-789a803a39e4",
                                                "sense_id": "42b932e2-5e84-3ac3-8237-56938c4c2d65",
                                                "text": "“Man, how long was I asleep? Those skeeto poppers really knocked me out.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3c91dce8-aa82-3254-b3bf-5305c8911ad3",
                                        "entry_id": "0e47271c-a792-3a18-9672-315318c6cc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A looner (balloon fetishist) who prefers to burst balloons."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c94b4cad-0468-4bf8-9bf7-3de36eb114ed",
                                                "sense_id": "3c91dce8-aa82-3254-b3bf-5305c8911ad3",
                                                "text": "Looners (as they call themselves) can generally be divided into two categories, regardless of whether they prefer their balloon play with a partner or alone: poppers and non-poppers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                        "entry_id": "0e47271c-a792-3a18-9672-315318c6cc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A capsule of amyl nitrite, a recreational drug used during sex."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b210faf5-4ab0-4554-bbf1-ae413ee9c654",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "If a person inhales a popper on the brink — the very brink — of climax, then the orgasm is much more powerful."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cbde963-69bd-4602-9abc-95a988db3528",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "Against all this was the counter-rhythm of the hip-flask and the drugs, that steady resorting at every pause for breath, to the swig of the secret drinker; or, high in his excitement, the burst of a popper and then the sucking sound of Cullen inhaling."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7d31b82-fecc-4d33-acf8-464c40768926",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "Then, suddenly, Vince sagged — light-headed. Too many poppers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6bcd935-9d4b-48aa-9671-e1a8e1420729",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "Looks like she's had too many poppers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7003c7f-c127-4eb8-b534-8db5c16f8e5c",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "When she heard Tuercas snap open a popper, she raised her own eyes instinctively. / His face was flushed red with the drug as he held the ampule to his nose"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adcf82bc-676d-4cfc-a1d8-a5a4cf333b09",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "I guess he was tricking with some other hustler a couple of days later and OD'd on one too many poppers—a heart attack in his sleep."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "395bba0f-c163-45b0-bd8f-d1caca1ca8a6",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "The annex still stood, and from inside came the grunting sounds of Eskimos and GIs in rut. Lavone was sitting near Rudy. He cracked an amyl popper."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7d49848-c93f-4eaa-9deb-5ab97062e3e5",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "Sucio paused in his dress-down of Barney's lineage, sexuality and potty habits to sample an amyl nitrate popper, which snapped his focus clear with cardiac paddle speed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4470971a-e184-4d30-9672-1f0ec9541f71",
                                                "sense_id": "86b677fb-80d2-3fa3-9d19-409da1c640d7",
                                                "text": "Too low. Must get higher! He cracked open a popper, inhaling deeply. Then another. For a brief but thankful moment, a faint high lifted through him. He clicked on the Internet icon, then his email. At that moment the marijuana, coke, and amyl nitrite collided in his bloodstream."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a0b780a-f67d-3916-bb27-071bbd29c8c1",
                                        "entry_id": "0e47271c-a792-3a18-9672-315318c6cc1d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Amyl nitrate."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f886fa8-7e27-4a00-b704-fd952f869c94",
                                                "sense_id": "5a0b780a-f67d-3916-bb27-071bbd29c8c1",
                                                "text": "Ryan knelt up in bed with his knees against Kick's side. \"You okay?\" Ryan asked. / \"Too much popper,\" he said. “Maybe I have jet lag."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02b55f91-8890-4ced-bb6c-a9e861053b3e",
                                                "sense_id": "5a0b780a-f67d-3916-bb27-071bbd29c8c1",
                                                "text": "Maybe he has some popper—that's a gay drug, right? Nicholas Nugent should at least have some popper . . . Art, leaning into the gaggle. Nicholas Nugent, shaking his pretty head. No popper. Do you think it's possible to popper yourself gay?"
                                            }
